siness_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"FCfTUUTYXfZchPvx7tkoWA","review_id":"htzVvYxzeXdPU8YkYyl9eg","date":"2021-11-09T21:11:52","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9426265954971313,"text_excerpt":"Very hip little taco/mezcal spot on Capdeville, in the space formerly occupied by a bar/restaurant by the same name. A couple tables outside, but you definitely need to step inside to appreciate the ambiance. I've had EM bookmarked for a year or two and finally made it in for lunch today. We were seated immediately at a table in the bar area (after vax verification, of course). The server did a great job. Started with a mezcal margarita and chips with two salsas. The drink was outstanding. The chips and salsa, were just okay IMO. Admittedly, I'm more of a fan of salsas with some texture... not necessarily chunky, but not the total liquid variety like their mild. The medium was a little be..."},{"business_id":"FCfTUUTYXfZchPvx7tkoWA","review_id":"fewirwMqyTDGlmfNlaGEPg","date":"2019-01-12T19:39:11","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9386876225471497,"text_excerpt":"I love this place. Been open just about two weeks. Excellent cocktails especially the Mezcal. I had one margarita with and one without to experience. Both were very good. You be the judge! The food the service and the place vibes were all great. We met 6 of our friends and enjoyed most of the snacks. The tacos were outstanding. Chico's and salsa were tasty and full of flavor. The crawfish dip was excellent. We will be back to enjoy more."},{"business_id":"FCfTUUTYXfZchPvx7tkoWA","review_id":"SwuIFZrjfgzESoAePHlLcQ","date":"2019-06-26T20:40:54","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9383886456489563,"text_excerpt":"Espiritu is located on a hidden side street. You wouldn't see it unless you are looking for it. I'm hoping that doesn't hurt their business because it was a decent experience. Happy hour is the draw here with $2 tacos and $5 margaritas. The tacos weren't your basic meat crumbs thrown into a plain shell either. The pork was overflowing and juicy. Definitely the best one. The sweet potato and black bean was a little lacking with the soyrizo being lost all together. Although the flavor was still delicious and even my meat eating friend liked it. The shrimp taco is not on happy hour sadly. $5 for a single taco is steep but it had good flavor and had enough shrimp. Tempura battered and tossed ..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"FCfTUUTYXfZchPvx7tkoWA","photo_id":"jym8HPCdYg299idi5gt8Jw","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/jym8HPCdYg299idi5gt8Jw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9204742908477783},{"business_id":"FCfTUUTYXfZchPvx7tkoWA","photo_id":"d6BHURoEiCNSciOvlTDdJA","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/d6BHURoEiCNSciOvlTDdJA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9100492000579834},{"business_id":"FCfTUUTYXfZchPvx7tkoWA","photo_id":"TKtm0N-_b8r4_ENxjZ57hQ","label":"menu","image_url":"/photos/TKtm0N-_b8r4_ENxjZ57hQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9048769474029541},{"busi